Package: aiimsulator
Title: Reproducible Sample Size Calculations and Manuscript-Ready Equations
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Naveen", family = "Suthar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aiims.drnaveen@gmail.com")
Description: Provides transparent sample size planning for estimation and
    independent-group hypothesis tests, diagnostic accuracy, receiver operating
    characteristic area under the curve, and correlation. Returns structured
    numerical results, general formulas, numerically substituted equations,
    assumptions, references, and selectively formatted methodological reports.
    Includes optional design-effect and finite-population adjustments for
    appropriate estimation designs. Methods use explicitly documented normal
    and Fisher-transformation approximations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/DrNaveen01/package-aiimsulator
BugReports: https://github.com/DrNaveen01/package-aiimsulator/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
